# avGFP_DMS/.gitignore
#
# Track the inputs and code, skip the large regenerable artifacts.
#   KEEP  : transform/embed/sweep scripts, notebooks, brightness_threshold.py,
#           the raw DMS tables and the (small) processed sequence CSVs, figures.
#   IGNORE: ESM-2 embedding caches (tens of GB), trained models, prediction caches,
#           and run logs -- all reproducible from the scripts above.

# ---- ESM-2 embedding caches (huge; rebuild with embed_dms.py) --------------------
# Covers esm_residue_fp16.npy (~31 GB), esm_residue_len.npy, the maxpool caches, and
# any future per-scaffold embedding array. The processed *_sequences.csv (the actual
# dataset) are .csv, so they are NOT matched here and stay tracked.
DMS_data/*.npy
DMS_data/.embed_progress

# ---- Trained models & cached predictions (rebuild with sweep_brightness.py) ------
trained_models/

# ---- Run logs / scratch ----------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log

# ---- Python / Jupyter cruft ------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
